    "text": "In the middle of difficulty lies opportunity. Great things are never done by one person, they are done by a team of people. Always focus on your goals and keep moving forward with confidence every day. Focus on the journey, not the destination, because joy is found in the process of learning. Focus on steady progress rather than perfection, because persistent effort always yields results.",
