    "text": "Life is what happens when you are busy making other plans. Enjoy the simple moments, treasure good friendships, and keep striving for excellence in whatever you do each day with enthusiasm and passion. Maintain a clear vision for the future while appreciating the present moment fully. Focus on steady progress rather than perfection, because persistent effort always yields results.",
    "category": "quotes",
    "source": "John Lennon",
