    "text": "Turn your wounds into wisdom and your obstacles into opportunities. Small daily improvements over time lead to stunning results. Never give up on a dream just because of the time it will take to accomplish it. Stay dedicated to your personal growth and keep expanding your horizons daily. Focus on steady progress rather than perfection, because persistent effort always yields results.",
