    "text": "Artificial intelligence enables software algorithms to learn from large amounts of training data. By recognizing patterns and relationships, AI systems can assist with language translation, image recognition, voice dictation, and medical diagnosis with high precision. As hardware grows smaller and more energy efficient, new innovative applications become possible. High speed network connectivity continues to expand opportunities for global collaboration.",
