    "text": "Cloud computing allows users and organizations to store files and run heavy applications on remote server data centers over the internet. This eliminates the need for expensive local hardware and makes data accessible from any smartphone, laptop, or tablet. Digital security and privacy remain essential considerations as more daily tasks move online. Thoughtfully built applications enhance daily workflow and user productivity substantially.",
