    "text": "Cybersecurity focuses on protecting digital systems, computer networks, and private data from unauthorized access or malicious attacks. Implementing strong passwords, multi-factor authentication, and regular software updates helps keep personal information secure. User awareness remains one of the most effective defenses against digital security risks. Thoughtfully built applications enhance daily workflow and user productivity substantially.",
